<BaseLayout title="Source notes and accuracy">
  <h1>Source notes and accuracy</h1>
  <p>This is an independent owner-maintained reference for the 2021-model-year, third-generation Volvo S60 range, with North American specifications as the primary reference. Some owner notes refer to a T5 Inscription AWD example. It is not factory service information and is not affiliated with Volvo Cars.</p>

  <h2>Source priority</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Vehicle-specific labels and VIN-linked build data:</strong> use these to identify the installed engine, transmission, brake package, paint code, wheels, and options.</li>
    <li><strong>2021 Volvo S60 owner's information:</strong> primary source for driver instructions, operating guidance, fluid specifications, and owner checks.</li>
    <li><strong>Volvo Car USA maintenance schedule:</strong> reference for scheduled service operations and mileage/time intervals; confirm applicability against the car's maintenance record and market.</li>
    <li><strong>Volvo Technical Information / authorized service data:</strong> required for repair procedures, wiring diagrams, component removal, torque values, fluid-level procedures, and diagnostic trees.</li>
    <li><strong>Independent repair references and owner reports:</strong> useful secondary context only; verify fitment and procedures before acting.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Known versus unconfirmed vehicle details</h2>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr><th>Known example vehicle</th><td>2021 S60 T5 Inscription AWD, Denim Blue exterior; this is not the assumed configuration for every page.</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Published engine specification</th><td>Volvo's 2021 support tables list multiple T5 engine-code alternatives and T6 AWD code B4204T27; use VIN-specific identification.</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Still requires VIN/build confirmation</th><td>Exact engine code, transmission code, rear drive unit/angle gear, brake package, wheel/tire package, and factory paint code.</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Not published as verified data</th><td>Unconfirmed torque values, component part numbers, transmission fluid selection without gearbox identification, and unverified fuse assignments.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

